[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-rapport@79c928255c6aee7b2b2b3b6a6f69c18a31ae978f/docs/img/hero.jpg[/img][/center]

[center][size=4][b]Without Rapport, an adult scene in Fallout 4 is just an animation playing. Rapport makes it feel alive. The two talk to each other, bystanders notice, faces follow the act, and everyone remembers who they were with.[/b][/size][/center]

[center]
